WEBVTT

00:00:02.956 --> 00:00:06.975
Instead of going to Southampton
in order to board a ship to America,

00:00:07.571 --> 00:00:10.534
...Candy mistakenly went the opposite way.

00:00:11.531 --> 00:00:17.922
Moreover, Candy had to work while traveling,
since she didn't take any money with herself.

00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:29.481
The star I saw
from the barn.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.433
This sea... it extends all the way to America
where Terry is living now...

00:00:57.074 --> 00:00:59.895
...and also to Africa and mr. Albert.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:06.255
I want to hurry back to Pony's home
and start anew!

00:01:09.729 --> 00:01:11.423
What's the matter, Kurin?

00:01:17.439 --> 00:01:18.660
Kurin, you!

00:01:21.906 --> 00:01:24.358
Don't shake hands with the crab, Kurin!

00:01:26.807 --> 00:01:28.391
Now, let's go, Kurin.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.597
We somehow need to get to Southampton.

00:01:45.729 --> 00:01:47.359
I'll ask for a job there.

00:01:50.762 --> 00:01:53.874
You want a job... so what can you do?

00:01:54.052 --> 00:01:58.065
I can do anything!
I can clean, do laundry, and cook!

00:01:58.932 --> 00:02:01.668
But you know, we don't really...

00:02:04.222 --> 00:02:06.577
Please! Give me something to do!

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:12.638
-Well... you could do the laundry, then?
-Yes! As you wish.

00:02:22.745 --> 00:02:24.945
Can you carry that much?

00:02:25.546 --> 00:02:26.863
I can manage!

00:02:29.301 --> 00:02:32.513
-Don't force yourself!
-With something this light?!

00:02:33.349 --> 00:02:35.469
Doesn't look light to me...

00:02:48.684 --> 00:02:52.202
It looks though the troubles I've gone through
in Eliza's house are paying off now.

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:54.720
I have to do everything!

00:03:04.146 --> 00:03:06.150
I'm done with the laundry...

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:10.717
Thanks. I prepared a lunch for you,
so why don't you take a break now.

00:03:11.237 --> 00:03:12.565
Thank you!

00:03:17.229 --> 00:03:18.023
Who is that girl?

00:03:19.216 --> 00:03:22.845
Looks though she wants to earn money
in order to travel to America.

00:03:23.572 --> 00:03:25.521
Oh, that must be hard.

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.246
You were a great help.

00:03:36.631 --> 00:03:40.082
Here, this is your pay.
Please take it.

00:03:41.388 --> 00:03:42.990
Thank you!

00:03:46.164 --> 00:03:49.299
-Take care of yourself, Candy.
-I will!

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:51.148
Let's go, Kurin.

00:03:59.284 --> 00:04:01.147
Everybody has been so kind to me!

00:04:01.478 --> 00:04:04.644
I could manage to return to Pony's home
sooner than I planned.

00:04:12.197 --> 00:04:13.259
Miss!

00:04:13.699 --> 00:04:15.159
Oh? You are...?

00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:18.329
Yes, we met at that restaurant
a little while ago.

00:04:18.364 --> 00:04:20.675
-I heard you're going to America?
-Yes!

00:04:21.617 --> 00:04:25.916
-So that means that you're heading to Southampton.
-Yes.

00:04:26.277 --> 00:04:30.360
I could give you a lift. I have some
things to do in the vicinity.

00:04:32.101 --> 00:04:33.206
Really?

00:04:35.644 --> 00:04:38.268
-Okay, get in.
-Thank you!

00:04:43.189 --> 00:04:46.649
-Please!
-Well, let's head to Southampton!

00:04:57.931 --> 00:05:01.006
...and so you renounced the name of the
Adley family which adopted you?

00:05:01.333 --> 00:05:05.993
Yes. I realized that I can't rely on them
if I was to find my own path in life.

00:05:07.445 --> 00:05:11.311
So have you informed that Pony's home of yours
that you'll be coming back?

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.244
No, I still haven't!

00:05:13.983 --> 00:05:15.407
It's better that way.

00:05:27.916 --> 00:05:32.066
Would you mind waiting for me a bit?
I'd like to speak to a friend.

00:05:32.101 --> 00:05:33.264
Yes, no problem!

00:05:37.712 --> 00:05:41.312
Kurin, I'm so glad we met such a friendly person.

00:05:43.846 --> 00:05:46.519
We might make it to Southampton by the evening.

00:05:46.958 --> 00:05:49.449
And then if I find a ship which will
let me work in exchange for a fare,

00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:51.294
...we could make it across the ocean to America!

00:05:51.647 --> 00:05:53.507
Anyway, we need to try!

00:05:54.213 --> 00:05:57.712
You found a good girl, there.

00:05:57.776 --> 00:06:00.287
Old man, she could rack up
an impressive price, right?

00:06:00.772 --> 00:06:04.875
I hear that there is a sailors' diner
down the road that hires servants.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.337
Well then, I'll sell her there.

00:06:08.094 --> 00:06:11.284
-That's good.
-Really, it is.

00:06:14.405 --> 00:06:16.720
-Hi, did you wait too long?
-No!

00:06:16.896 --> 00:06:18.137
Now, let's go!

00:06:27.806 --> 00:06:31.554
-I'll see a friend here, as well.
-You have a lot of friends!

00:06:32.801 --> 00:06:35.799
Candy, why don't you come with me?
You can wait inside.

00:06:35.989 --> 00:06:38.502
Don't worry, Kurin, I'll be back soon!

00:06:46.461 --> 00:06:48.345
-Let's go.
-Okay!

00:06:51.046 --> 00:06:55.786
Candy, sit here and wait a bit.
I'll have a word with the landlady.

00:07:03.984 --> 00:07:06.358
I guess I'll wash my hands, too!

00:07:12.285 --> 00:07:14.969
Eh? You want to sell that girl?

00:07:15.359 --> 00:07:18.805
What do you think, madam?
She probably can't sell for much.

00:07:18.981 --> 00:07:23.025
That's right... because most of our customers
are thugs and sailors...

00:07:23.159 --> 00:07:26.160
Anyway, if we bought such a girl, we might
start getting more customers.

00:07:26.351 --> 00:07:29.797
She is healthy, so you could work her hard
with no problems.

00:07:31.714 --> 00:07:34.971
Those people are slave traders!
I have to beat it now!

00:07:36.769 --> 00:07:37.705
Who is that?

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.489
She overheard us!

00:07:41.839 --> 00:07:43.122
Wait! Hey!

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.042
-My carriage!
-You can use my horse!

00:08:06.235 --> 00:08:08.047
Alright! I'll catch her for sure!

00:08:20.253 --> 00:08:21.575
He caught up to me!

00:08:22.244 --> 00:08:25.200
Dammit, who do you think you're kidding?

00:08:33.098 --> 00:08:34.855
Alright, you're not getting away!

00:08:50.808 --> 00:08:51.764
Brace yourself, Kurin!

00:09:02.261 --> 00:09:05.307
Let's flee as far as possible
while we can!

00:09:20.684 --> 00:09:22.802
I must flee!
Anywhere!

00:09:22.837 --> 00:09:24.159
I have to run away!

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.513
I have to flee further.

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.222
Kurin, we're saved!

00:09:54.251 --> 00:09:57.374
Where did that girl go?

00:09:57.521 --> 00:09:59.407
Kurin, let's hide in the straw.

00:10:02.109 --> 00:10:05.631
If it's come down to this...
everything is in God's hands now.

00:10:24.118 --> 00:10:26.810
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
I'm boozing as I write this. I'll probably be
totally plastered by the end of the episode.

00:10:54.364 --> 00:10:56.935
God came to our help.

00:11:11.038 --> 00:11:13.392
Mom! There goes mr. Carson!

00:11:13.929 --> 00:11:15.325
Pretend you didn't see him!

00:11:16.825 --> 00:11:19.075
He refused your help as well?

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:22.243
Yes. The villagers wanted to help him but...

00:11:24.322 --> 00:11:27.135
Carson was doing better while his wife
was still alive.

00:11:27.895 --> 00:11:29.977
He turned into a violent eccentric...

00:11:30.012 --> 00:11:32.702
Can't this lazy old horse go any faster?

00:11:33.964 --> 00:11:36.703
These guys are annoying like everybody else!

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.860
It's dad!

00:11:48.996 --> 00:11:51.320
Brother, dad's come back!

00:11:54.756 --> 00:11:57.563
-Dad, welcome back!
-Welcome back!

00:11:59.267 --> 00:12:03.248
Everybody, you doing well?
I brought you some apples as a present.

00:12:08.371 --> 00:12:11.366
Dad, I'm sorry. I burnt the stew
and it's become all black.

00:12:11.401 --> 00:12:14.345
Why worry about that?
You're gonna get good at it eventually.

00:12:15.408 --> 00:12:16.936
Dad, I'll take the horse.

00:12:21.966 --> 00:12:23.855
Susy, what's the matter?

00:12:25.449 --> 00:12:26.791
You didn't say anything.

00:12:27.561 --> 00:12:31.078
Dad, there aren't any apples.
But there's a girl sleeping in here.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.433
A girl? What are you saying, Jeff?

00:12:34.468 --> 00:12:37.618
It's true! You didn't mean to bring her, dad?

00:12:38.357 --> 00:12:39.306
What?

00:12:41.418 --> 00:12:44.335
Eh? She ate all the apples.

00:12:44.569 --> 00:12:45.524
Who is she?

00:12:45.813 --> 00:12:47.631
Dad... she woke up!

00:12:48.826 --> 00:12:49.929
What are you?!

00:12:52.748 --> 00:12:54.935
You went into my wagon without asking!

00:12:56.056 --> 00:12:59.543
Forgive me!
Kurin, hide in the straw!

00:13:01.548 --> 00:13:04.314
Get off now, or I'll pull you out myself!

00:13:04.834 --> 00:13:08.172
I'm sorry! I was tired and I fell asleep...
I'll get off now.

00:13:10.376 --> 00:13:12.229
But I slept so well!

00:13:12.987 --> 00:13:14.786
Sis, you're good!

00:13:15.014 --> 00:13:15.896
Thanks.

00:13:16.807 --> 00:13:19.689
Mister, I'll pay you for the apples.

00:13:20.472 --> 00:13:21.521
It's gone!

00:13:22.287 --> 00:13:25.728
That's right... I must have dropped it
while I was running.

00:13:26.156 --> 00:13:29.513
I... I lost my money.

00:13:29.548 --> 00:13:32.686
What? You had no money to begin with!

00:13:39.777 --> 00:13:42.262
Mister, is Southampton nearby?

00:13:43.061 --> 00:13:44.803
It's a long way towards there...

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.791
I missed again...

00:13:52.513 --> 00:13:54.144
Uh, mister...

00:13:54.313 --> 00:13:56.035
Shut up! Get lost!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:14:01.881
I don't have any money... but if you let me
stay here for tonight, I'd work to pay you...

00:14:02.071 --> 00:14:04.547
Can't do that! There is no room for you!

00:14:04.979 --> 00:14:06.575
I'd do anything...

00:14:07.492 --> 00:14:10.614
Sam, Jeff, Susy! Come inside!
Dinner!

00:14:15.069 --> 00:14:20.766
You tightwad! I thought you'd be unfriendly,
but I wasn't expecting this!

00:14:28.264 --> 00:14:31.990
Come! If you're okay with that, you can
stay in the barn without our dad knowing.

00:14:32.569 --> 00:14:33.981
Thank you!

00:14:34.037 --> 00:14:35.524
Sis, hurry!

00:14:38.017 --> 00:14:39.194
Quiet!

00:14:39.392 --> 00:14:41.439
Let's hurry before dad sees us!

00:14:43.294 --> 00:14:45.615
What's the matter? Are you okay?

00:14:47.159 --> 00:14:48.414
I'm okay.

00:14:48.603 --> 00:14:50.964
Susy, don't scare me!

00:14:51.168 --> 00:14:52.885
Thank you, everyone.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.190
I wouldn't know what to do
now that it's gotten dark.

00:14:56.218 --> 00:15:00.349
We'll welcome you instead of our dad!
Okay?

00:15:02.269 --> 00:15:05.315
I'm sorry for eating all of your apples...

00:15:05.524 --> 00:15:07.777
You were hungry, weren't you, sis?

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:14.698
-Sis, take care, it's dark in here.
-It's okay.

00:15:20.513 --> 00:15:23.876
Well then, sis!
Make sure our dad doesn't see you!

00:15:24.057 --> 00:15:25.699
Okay. Thanks.

00:15:27.715 --> 00:15:30.284
Those kids saved me!

00:15:40.402 --> 00:15:42.690
Kurin, we'll be staying here tonight.

00:15:44.765 --> 00:15:48.031
So warm! The smell of hay...
What a wonderful bed!

00:15:50.974 --> 00:15:53.851
I wonder if grandfather William
already received my letter.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.730
Grandfather William...

00:15:56.691 --> 00:16:02.047
Archie, Stear, Annie, Patty...
Everyone, I'm so sorry.

00:16:02.791 --> 00:16:05.515
I wonder what is Terry doing right now.

00:16:21.933 --> 00:16:25.791
I ran... I ran till I lost my breath...

00:16:26.118 --> 00:16:27.943
But I came too late to see him.

00:16:28.194 --> 00:16:30.107
I only stood there in silence.

00:16:30.739 --> 00:16:32.935
Terry was slowly moving away from me.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.469
Terry went away.

00:16:37.911 --> 00:16:42.206
And I'm in the barn of an unknown family...

00:16:46.092 --> 00:16:47.654
Dad fell asleep.

00:16:48.027 --> 00:16:50.373
And you came to see me?

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.970
Sis, you're hungry?

00:16:54.515 --> 00:16:56.110
Here! Milk.

00:16:57.339 --> 00:16:58.688
You...

00:17:01.877 --> 00:17:02.837
Here.

00:17:02.959 --> 00:17:05.437
Everyone... thank you.

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:10.127
I... I'm not worthy of such hospitality.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:13.469
It's okay! Sis, it's because you're our guest!

00:17:13.655 --> 00:17:14.223
Yeah!

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.311
I'm Sam.

00:17:20.444 --> 00:17:21.511
I'm Jeff.

00:17:21.866 --> 00:17:23.692
I'm Susy.

00:17:24.087 --> 00:17:25.894
And I'm Candy. Nice to meet you!

00:17:26.391 --> 00:17:28.520
This is my raccoon, Kurin.

00:17:30.905 --> 00:17:32.035
Hello!

00:17:33.016 --> 00:17:37.456
I've never been a guest in such a
wonderful place. Thank you so much!

00:17:39.898 --> 00:17:44.519
Ever since Mom went over the Mount Rodney,
nobody comes to our place anymore.

00:17:45.783 --> 00:17:47.156
Mount Rodney?

00:17:54.016 --> 00:17:55.910
Look! It's that mountain over there.

00:17:56.037 --> 00:17:59.651
Mom went over that hill but she didn't come back.

00:18:00.437 --> 00:18:03.804
I want to see mom.

00:18:04.227 --> 00:18:10.008
Both of you, how many times have I told you?
Our mom is dead! She went to heaven!

00:18:13.261 --> 00:18:17.020
Heaven is behind the Mount Rodney?

00:18:20.225 --> 00:18:23.850
No. You wouldn't understand if I
explained it to you, anyway...

00:18:25.711 --> 00:18:26.907
Sam.

00:18:28.024 --> 00:18:33.710
Even though mom won't be coming back,
those two keep waiting for her...

00:18:48.829 --> 00:18:51.925
Be quiet! You'll wake up dad...

00:18:52.755 --> 00:18:56.886
Sorry, Jeff.
Heaven is behind Mount Rodney, after all.

00:18:56.887 --> 00:18:58.569
Is that true, sis?

00:18:59.366 --> 00:19:00.322
Yes...

00:19:00.815 --> 00:19:04.042
Then, mom will return one day?

00:19:07.017 --> 00:19:09.762
It's getting late, so why don't you
return to your rooms...

00:19:09.797 --> 00:19:11.210
Sis! Susy has...

00:19:11.245 --> 00:19:12.798
Susy! What's the matter?

00:19:14.493 --> 00:19:15.591
Susy!

00:19:19.443 --> 00:19:20.531
She is burning.

00:19:20.669 --> 00:19:22.839
Sam, hurry and wake up your dad.

00:19:24.831 --> 00:19:25.687
Hey!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.291
What are you doing in here?

00:19:29.609 --> 00:19:32.784
Quickly, call the doctor... Susy has a fever!

00:19:33.129 --> 00:19:34.121
What?

00:19:37.965 --> 00:19:40.566
It's true.
Hang in there, Susy!

00:19:40.856 --> 00:19:42.981
Why didn't you say anything, Susy?

00:19:43.559 --> 00:19:46.501
Susy, hang in there! Susy!

00:19:47.812 --> 00:19:51.831
Mr. Carson, hurry and put Susy in bed.
Sam, call the doctor.

00:19:54.186 --> 00:19:55.084
Sam!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:59.815
That's impossible, sis!
The doctor won't come!

00:20:00.429 --> 00:20:01.549
Why?

00:20:01.903 --> 00:20:03.263
The doctor ain't gonna touch her!

00:20:05.618 --> 00:20:07.490
It's his fault that my wife died!

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:13.709
Those ne'er-do-well villagers sided
with horrible doctor who killed my wife!

00:20:23.779 --> 00:20:26.736
Shit! If that guy shows up here again,
I'm gonna tear him apart!

00:20:27.321 --> 00:20:30.551
Susy? Susy, what's the matter?
Open your eyes.

00:20:30.744 --> 00:20:31.724
Susy!

00:20:32.144 --> 00:20:33.198
Susy!

00:20:34.205 --> 00:20:36.822
Mr. Carson! Are you trying to kill Susy?

00:20:37.869 --> 00:20:41.815
Sam, lead me to doctor's house.
I'm going to call him over.

00:20:41.850 --> 00:20:42.844
He's not going to come!

00:20:43.116 --> 00:20:48.153
Mr. Carson! Don't shout around sick people!
Her disease will get worse!

00:20:51.337 --> 00:20:52.715
Sam, let's go!

00:21:02.239 --> 00:21:05.255
Susy, hang in there!
Susy!

00:21:06.783 --> 00:21:11.003
Believing that the doctor will agree to come
when he learns of the circumstances,

00:21:12.131 --> 00:21:15.584
...Candy ran into the fog.

00:21:15.585 --> 00:21:20.465
To be continued...
